content:
Abin da ɗango ya bari
    fāri masu girma sun cinye;
  abin da fāri masu girma suka bari,
    burduduwa ta cinye;
  abin da burduduwa ta bari sauran kwari sun cinye.

Har ma namun jeji suna haki gare ka;
    rafuffuka sun bushe
    wuta kuma ta cinye wurin kiwo a jeji.

A tattara mutane;
    ku tsarkake taron;
  ku kawo dattawa wuri ɗaya;
    ku kuma tara yara,
    da waɗanda suke shan mama.
  Bari ango yă bar ɗakinsa
    amarya kuma lolokinta.

Kada ki ji tsoro, ya ƙasa;
    ki yi murna ki kuma yi farin ciki.
  Tabbatacce Ubangiji ya yi abubuwa masu girma.
